name: ptt-resume
description: "Continue as a holder in a fresh session or after /clear: binds the holder name to this session and catches up from the records. Argument: the holder name (integrator-1, designer-g1, worker-T0007), or none to continue the holder that left a handover."
disable-model-invocation: true
